WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:29.910 --> 01:31.180
[My Journey to You]

01:31.200 --> 01:34.120
[Episode 16]

02:02.540 --> 02:03.110
Do you...

02:04.580 --> 02:05.420
like me?

03:00.470 --> 03:01.530
Young Master Ziyu.

03:02.050 --> 03:03.510
Drink the medicine first.

03:04.840 --> 03:08.500
Otherwise, the hot poison in your body will make you suffer again.

03:09.460 --> 03:11.320
If it weren't for the truth grass,

03:14.780 --> 03:15.890
I might never have

03:17.870 --> 03:20.270
heard your true feelings in this lifetime.

03:24.360 --> 03:26.020
Even without the truth grass,

03:27.510 --> 03:28.850
what I say to you

03:29.780 --> 03:31.079
is always true.

04:38.890 --> 04:40.659
Don't ruin my mortar.

04:41.120 --> 04:43.120
I’ll compensate you if it’s ruined.

04:52.020 --> 04:52.710
Elder Yue.

04:54.460 --> 04:55.590
Can your truth grass

04:56.790 --> 04:57.650
make mistakes?

04:59.940 --> 05:01.670
What answer do you want to hear?

05:05.550 --> 05:06.240
The truth.

05:08.030 --> 05:09.830
You saved her life several times

05:10.420 --> 05:12.480
and tested the medicine on yourself.

05:13.070 --> 05:14.000
Do you regret it?

05:24.830 --> 05:27.290
I'm not working hard to develop the antidote

05:28.470 --> 05:29.580
just for her,

05:31.390 --> 05:32.630
but also for myself.

05:35.020 --> 05:36.150
To pass the trial,

05:36.830 --> 05:38.290
become the Sword Wielder,

05:38.650 --> 05:39.909
and protect my people.

05:41.909 --> 05:43.970
Although I don't like Gong Shangjue,

05:45.250 --> 05:46.510
he's right.

05:48.400 --> 05:50.250
If I only care about romance,

05:52.500 --> 05:54.870
and can even risk the lives of my family...

05:58.150 --> 06:00.410
I don't deserve the Sword Wielder title.

06:04.510 --> 06:06.310
Young Master Ziyu, you're young

06:06.420 --> 06:07.470
and thoughtful.

06:07.960 --> 06:10.020
It's the blessing of the Gong family.

06:11.700 --> 06:13.060
But when you have a big heart,

06:13.060 --> 06:14.590
it'll contain many things.

06:14.950 --> 06:17.280
It's inevitable that your heart is heavy.

06:19.300 --> 06:20.020
One's heart

06:20.860 --> 06:23.150
is like a big empty house.

06:25.290 --> 06:27.850
All the wealth and material goods in this world

06:27.850 --> 06:30.010
are not enough to fill it up.

06:31.440 --> 06:33.500
But as long as there is a little light,

06:34.150 --> 06:35.280
just a little light,

06:36.740 --> 06:38.600
it can fill up one's entire heart.

06:41.990 --> 06:43.850
When your heart has brightened up

06:44.150 --> 06:45.080
and become warm,

06:46.230 --> 06:47.890
it wouldn't be heavy anymore.

06:52.030 --> 06:53.560
Do you know how love begins?

06:56.710 --> 06:57.510
Of course.

06:59.490 --> 07:00.730
Love begins

07:01.710 --> 07:03.640
with a little flutter of the heart.

07:13.290 --> 07:14.360
It's always good

07:14.820 --> 07:15.850
for one's heart

07:17.220 --> 07:18.480
to have a little light.

07:29.550 --> 07:30.740
Love begins

07:32.909 --> 07:34.840
with a little flutter of the heart.

08:00.300 --> 08:01.430
You wanted to see me?

08:02.880 --> 08:03.810
Where did you go?

08:05.090 --> 08:07.110
Your body hasn't been detoxified of the poison yet.

08:07.110 --> 08:09.380
If your limbs became paralyzed outside,

08:09.840 --> 08:10.850
no one would know.

08:22.230 --> 08:24.760
I saw that you left on your own accord just now.

08:25.260 --> 08:28.190
I thought you didn't want to see me for the time being.

08:30.680 --> 08:31.680
I didn't say that.

08:38.659 --> 08:39.520
I asked you here

08:40.020 --> 08:40.990
to tell you

08:43.570 --> 08:44.960
that I've figured out how to make

08:44.960 --> 08:47.290
the antidote to the Heart Devouring Moon.

09:09.310 --> 09:09.910
Elder Yue.

09:10.710 --> 09:11.910
Please have some tea.

09:30.610 --> 09:31.240
I heard

09:31.870 --> 09:33.670
that the antidote has been made.

09:36.660 --> 09:38.060
I'm boiling it right now.

09:38.630 --> 09:39.350
In a while,

09:39.980 --> 09:41.220
you can

09:41.870 --> 09:42.750
check it.

09:46.220 --> 09:46.720
Okay.

10:08.210 --> 10:08.810
Elder Yue.

10:17.070 --> 10:17.730
Elder Yue.

10:36.360 --> 10:37.050
Elder Yue.

10:38.020 --> 10:38.860
I’m sorry.

10:41.990 --> 10:42.830
Please tell me

10:44.950 --> 10:48.150
the ingredients of the Heart Devouring Moon's antidote.

11:02.660 --> 11:04.120
One liter of crow-dipper,

11:04.910 --> 11:07.110
half a tael of Fritillaria thunbergii,

11:07.680 --> 11:09.610
one tael of Chinese ground orchid,

11:10.330 --> 11:11.570
ten Lianshan seeds,

11:15.540 --> 11:17.540
and the most important three herbs.

11:19.280 --> 11:20.540
Three taels of Wujiang

11:21.540 --> 11:23.000
and three taels of Jiemao.

11:24.900 --> 11:26.300
Between these two herbs,

11:27.590 --> 11:29.590
the most important herb is missing.

11:32.280 --> 11:33.610
The most important herb

11:37.050 --> 11:38.100
is the Xuyu grass.

12:06.980 --> 12:09.170
Why is there only one tael of Xuyu grass?

12:09.170 --> 12:11.300
It's only enough to make one antidote.

12:11.620 --> 12:13.530
There's not much Xuyu grass in the storehouse.

12:13.530 --> 12:16.350
This is the only tael of it in the entire Yue residence.

12:16.350 --> 12:17.480
What a coincidence.

12:18.850 --> 12:19.910
I don't believe it.

12:25.190 --> 12:26.750
Could it be that Elder Yue's angry

12:26.750 --> 12:29.210
because I deceived him with the truth grass?

12:30.780 --> 12:32.780
The Xuyu grass has always been rare.

12:32.820 --> 12:34.420
In the years where winters are long and summers are short,

12:34.420 --> 12:36.920
it can only be procured from the snowy mountain peaks.

12:36.920 --> 12:38.760
Last year, there was abundant rainfall

12:38.760 --> 12:39.960
and the summer was long,

12:39.960 --> 12:41.420
so there's a lack of stock.

12:42.480 --> 12:44.600
Does the pharmacy at the front hill have it?

12:44.600 --> 12:45.630
All the herbs in the Gong residence

12:45.630 --> 12:47.690
are given to the Yue residence first.

12:48.110 --> 12:50.380
If there isn't any in the Yue residence's storehouse,

12:50.380 --> 12:53.640
then it's impossible that there'd be any at the front hill.

13:20.950 --> 13:22.940
Keep these Xuyu grass well.

13:23.630 --> 13:25.090
It's such a precious herb.

13:25.860 --> 13:26.920
We mustn't lose it.

13:27.860 --> 13:28.320
Yes.

13:36.910 --> 13:38.240
Why send the green silk?

13:39.350 --> 13:41.280
Worry about your lack of clothing.

13:42.620 --> 13:44.020
Not envious of the world.

13:46.550 --> 13:48.810
Dangerous clouds interwoven with rain.

13:51.300 --> 13:52.940
It'll depend on what choice

13:53.990 --> 13:55.450
this little couple makes.

14:56.670 --> 14:58.200
Why aren't you coming here?

15:00.940 --> 15:03.340
I don't want to disturb you playing the qin.

15:05.390 --> 15:06.590
You won't disturb me.

15:06.990 --> 15:07.590
Come over.

15:16.270 --> 15:18.000
My legs are already paralyzed.

15:18.750 --> 15:20.610
It's inconvenient for me to walk.

15:21.370 --> 15:22.030
Otherwise,

15:23.410 --> 15:24.880
I'd go to your side.

15:54.270 --> 15:56.010
This is for Young Master Ziyu

15:56.600 --> 15:58.060
to relieve the hot poison.

15:58.430 --> 15:59.250
This medicine

15:59.770 --> 16:00.720
is for Miss Yun

16:02.380 --> 16:03.910
to relieve the cold poison.

16:20.930 --> 16:21.960
I didn't expect

16:23.160 --> 16:25.090
you to be so good at playing the qin.

16:29.500 --> 16:30.630
Ziyi taught me this.

16:48.550 --> 16:50.350
There are trees in the mountains

16:51.370 --> 16:52.630
and branches on trees.

16:55.340 --> 16:56.700
I love you,

16:58.970 --> 17:00.300
but you don't know that.

17:05.300 --> 17:08.230
The wanderer in the vast and high-walled courtyard.

17:09.869 --> 17:11.470
Having no fixed place to live

17:13.470 --> 17:14.930
but having a peace of mind.

17:25.339 --> 17:26.170
But

17:27.390 --> 17:28.460
Ziyi told me

17:29.930 --> 17:31.060
that since I'm a man,

17:32.690 --> 17:33.840
this kind of song

17:34.940 --> 17:36.800
is too sentimental for me to play.

17:41.150 --> 17:42.620
My sister once asked me

17:44.890 --> 17:46.350
whether I wanted to be a cat

17:47.660 --> 17:48.670
or a dog.

17:53.690 --> 17:55.950
Why are you suddenly talking about this?

17:57.220 --> 17:59.300
The kittens on the streets are free,

18:01.950 --> 18:04.210
but they are wandering around aimlessly

18:04.870 --> 18:05.840
without a home.

18:09.850 --> 18:13.250
Dogs in vast and high-walled courtyards have a place to stay,

18:16.780 --> 18:19.580
but they have to be subservient to others forever.

18:24.510 --> 18:25.350
She asked me

18:30.220 --> 18:31.190
how I'd choose.

18:49.630 --> 18:50.160
Wait.

19:01.190 --> 19:02.390
I've finished making

19:02.990 --> 19:04.150
the antidote.

19:06.880 --> 19:09.080
You don't need to drink this from now on.

19:14.060 --> 19:17.120
I know that this antidote is only enough for one person.

19:18.450 --> 19:19.690
I won't take it.

19:25.640 --> 19:26.770
I told you

19:27.890 --> 19:29.290
I'd definitely save you.

19:30.910 --> 19:32.570
So I'd never break my promise.

19:35.130 --> 19:36.600
You also told me

19:38.030 --> 19:40.030
that you married into the Gong family

19:40.030 --> 19:41.580
just to seek protection

19:41.960 --> 19:43.360
and live a peaceful life.

19:45.410 --> 19:46.980
Then I'll fulfill your wish

19:48.940 --> 19:49.920
and protect you.

20:26.390 --> 20:27.480
Why did you do that?

20:28.410 --> 20:29.460
Do you want to die?

20:31.310 --> 20:33.570
You're the Gong family's Sword Wielder.

20:33.620 --> 20:36.020
No one's life is more important than yours.

20:37.100 --> 20:37.920
If you die,

20:39.290 --> 20:40.950
they won't let me live either.

20:57.460 --> 20:58.260
I won.

21:08.490 --> 21:10.080
I made a bet with God.

21:13.300 --> 21:14.560
I bet that you like me.

21:17.730 --> 21:18.570
I bet

21:23.170 --> 21:25.770
that you would give up your chance to live to me.

21:30.190 --> 21:31.850
That bowl of medicine just now

21:33.400 --> 21:34.770
is the real antidote.

22:01.950 --> 22:03.250
Why are you so foolish?

22:13.960 --> 22:15.430
Why are you so foolish?

22:48.710 --> 22:49.240
Yun.

22:50.560 --> 22:51.190
Yun!

22:56.630 --> 22:57.280
Elder Yue.

22:58.040 --> 22:59.170
Why did you hurt her?

22:59.930 --> 23:00.870
Elder Yue!

23:04.380 --> 23:04.970
Yun.

23:07.110 --> 23:07.680
Yun!

23:46.630 --> 23:47.470
Yun!

24:42.060 --> 24:44.430
Young Master Yuanzhi, you have so much morning dew on you.

24:44.430 --> 24:46.560
Did you go and tend to the plants again?

24:47.860 --> 24:48.920
Morning, brother.

24:52.350 --> 24:54.350
What rare flowers and herbs are they

24:54.450 --> 24:57.310
that they have to be personally taken care of by you?

24:57.840 --> 25:00.100
I'm afraid you won't know even if I say it.

25:00.610 --> 25:01.740
Chuyun Chonglian.

25:02.390 --> 25:03.520
Have you heard of it?

25:04.710 --> 25:06.040
I read about it in a book.

25:07.020 --> 25:09.470
The Chuyun Chonglian is a rare flower in the world

25:09.470 --> 25:10.800
and also a magical herb.

25:12.690 --> 25:14.450
Isn't it already extinct?

25:14.890 --> 25:15.820
Unfortunately,

25:16.220 --> 25:17.600
this rare flower in the world

25:17.600 --> 25:19.330
was for the use of someone else.

25:22.630 --> 25:25.920
Brother Yuanzhi originally planted the Chuyun Chonglian,

25:25.920 --> 25:27.830
but it was taken and used by

25:28.550 --> 25:29.720
the former Young Lord Gong Huanyu.

25:29.720 --> 25:31.120
Why did you give it to him?

25:31.760 --> 25:32.850
Back then, Gong Huanyu

25:32.850 --> 25:34.110
was practicing the...

25:34.430 --> 25:35.630
Divine Stone Skill,

25:36.050 --> 25:38.170
but couldn't make a breakthrough no matter what.

25:38.170 --> 25:39.260
So the former Sword Wielder asked me

25:39.260 --> 25:41.720
to give him the Chuyun Chonglian for his consumption.

25:41.720 --> 25:42.450
As expected,

25:42.940 --> 25:45.900
with the miraculous medicine, he mastered the skill.

25:45.900 --> 25:47.870
If it weren't for the former Sword Wielder's order,

25:47.870 --> 25:50.530
I wouldn't have given him the Chuyun Chonglian.

25:50.810 --> 25:52.340
I planted it for my brother.

25:53.230 --> 25:54.770
According to the old medical book,

25:54.770 --> 25:56.990
Chuyun Chonglian is extremely precious.

25:56.990 --> 25:57.980
Martial artists

25:58.100 --> 25:59.560
can increase their power.

25:59.780 --> 26:01.910
Even the sick can be resurrected.

26:04.470 --> 26:06.670
The former Sword Wielder was so biased.

26:08.500 --> 26:09.990
Lady Wuji heard that Miss Shangguan

26:09.990 --> 26:11.250
needs golden gentian,

26:11.360 --> 26:12.910
so she specially asked me to come and tell you

26:12.910 --> 26:15.110
that she'll share some of hers with you.

26:18.210 --> 26:19.740
Lady Wuji is so thoughtful.

26:20.060 --> 26:22.120
This was just a misunderstanding anyway.

26:22.120 --> 26:23.140
I should also

26:23.290 --> 26:25.500
visit her and apologize.

26:26.440 --> 26:29.040
I'll relay your message to Lady Wuji right now.

26:32.790 --> 26:33.420
I think...

26:33.420 --> 26:33.840
Go.

26:36.080 --> 26:36.690
Okay.

27:12.550 --> 27:13.560
You're smart.

27:14.290 --> 27:16.220
Not only do you have an escape plan,

27:16.230 --> 27:18.030
but you also know how to retreat.

27:19.230 --> 27:20.760
You know what should be said

27:22.010 --> 27:23.540
and what shouldn't be said.

27:27.170 --> 27:28.700
Senior, I'm just suffering

27:29.230 --> 27:30.700
and taking the blame in your stead.

27:30.700 --> 27:31.690
It's my duty.

27:33.070 --> 27:35.930
It's better than both of us suffering great losses.

27:36.920 --> 27:37.760
But...

27:40.150 --> 27:41.410
What do you want to say?

27:42.930 --> 27:46.010
Anonymous has been undercover successfully for so many years.

27:46.010 --> 27:47.870
Why did she take action suddenly?

27:49.900 --> 27:51.300
Are you asking Anonymous

27:51.390 --> 27:52.170
or me?

27:54.990 --> 27:55.720
Stop acting.

28:01.220 --> 28:02.680
Aren't you doing the same?

28:04.100 --> 28:05.070
A Wufeng spy

28:05.740 --> 28:08.200
should try to get close to the Sword Wielder.

28:09.160 --> 28:11.690
Why do you keep hanging around Gong Shangjue?

28:18.240 --> 28:19.730
Is there someone else

28:20.780 --> 28:21.910
by Gong Ziyu's side?

28:25.630 --> 28:26.890
Chi, Mei, Wang, Liang.

28:27.380 --> 28:28.640
We act alone in the dark

28:29.200 --> 28:30.550
without keeping in contact

28:30.550 --> 28:32.210
or asking each other's names.

28:33.260 --> 28:35.630
You've left Wufeng for too long,

28:36.220 --> 28:38.280
so you must have forgotten the rules.

28:38.830 --> 28:41.490
How would I know about other people's missions?

28:42.170 --> 28:43.630
Then what's your mission?

28:45.190 --> 28:46.850
To get close to Gong Shangjue?

28:48.990 --> 28:50.080
What if

28:51.090 --> 28:53.020
I tell you we have the same mission?

28:56.030 --> 28:57.350
The July Heat...

28:59.030 --> 29:00.290
Immeasurable merits.

29:09.890 --> 29:12.090
You can use these golden gentian first.

29:13.590 --> 29:15.520
If you need anything in the future,

29:16.180 --> 29:17.640
you can come to me anytime.

29:24.810 --> 29:25.920
It's quite heavy.

29:32.810 --> 29:33.650
Truth grass?

29:34.750 --> 29:35.250
Yes.

29:36.780 --> 29:37.780
What do you think?

29:39.220 --> 29:40.750
In terms of making antidotes,

29:40.750 --> 29:42.520
Elder Yue is not inferior to me.

29:43.590 --> 29:45.210
If he personally made it,

29:46.660 --> 29:48.120
it should be trustworthy.

29:50.710 --> 29:53.570
But I don't believe Yun Weishan's not problematic.

29:53.590 --> 29:54.510
Neither do I.

29:55.900 --> 29:56.720
But Elder Yue

29:57.680 --> 29:58.380
didn't have to

29:58.380 --> 30:00.410
cover up for a Wufeng assassin.

30:03.940 --> 30:05.330
What did Elder Yue say

30:05.810 --> 30:08.060
about Housekeeper Jia's son's illness?

30:08.060 --> 30:09.920
Elder Yue agreed to investigate.

30:10.770 --> 30:11.420
But...

30:13.480 --> 30:14.090
But what?

30:15.980 --> 30:16.510
Brother.

30:17.320 --> 30:17.980
Nothing.

30:25.100 --> 30:26.500
Chuyun Chonglian

30:28.100 --> 30:29.630
can cure all diseases

30:31.990 --> 30:33.750
and bring the dead back to life.

30:47.430 --> 30:48.560
In these books,

30:49.380 --> 30:52.640
the medicinal properties of many medicinal herbs are mentioned.

30:52.640 --> 30:53.970
Have you tried them all?

30:55.510 --> 30:56.240
For example,

30:56.750 --> 30:57.340
Wujiang.

30:58.690 --> 31:00.020
Three taels of Wujiang.

31:00.870 --> 31:01.930
What about Jiemao?

31:02.470 --> 31:03.730
Three taels of Jiemao.

31:51.160 --> 31:53.560
The most important herb that's missing...

31:55.090 --> 31:56.120
is the Xuyu grass.

32:20.440 --> 32:24.460
[Jiemao] [Xuyu grass] [Wujiang]

32:25.740 --> 32:28.200
"Wu xu jie", that it doesn't need to be cured!

34:22.659 --> 34:24.320
Is the paralysis in your limbs

34:24.969 --> 34:25.830
all gone?

34:26.780 --> 34:27.370
Yes.

34:29.150 --> 34:31.610
You don't cough up blood anymore too, right?

34:50.300 --> 34:51.900
Congratulations, Miss Yun.

34:53.710 --> 34:55.909
Congratulations, Lord Sword Wielder.

34:56.590 --> 34:57.850
You just called him...

34:58.980 --> 35:00.110
Lord Sword Wielder?

35:00.520 --> 35:01.170
Yes.

35:02.820 --> 35:05.010
Young Master Ziyu passed the trial successfully.

35:05.010 --> 35:05.980
In my heart,

35:06.520 --> 35:08.450
he's already a true Sword Wielder.

35:11.500 --> 35:12.150
So,

35:14.300 --> 35:15.950
you've gotten rid of the Heart Devouring Moon

35:15.950 --> 35:16.960
in our bodies?

35:18.660 --> 35:19.270
No.

35:20.430 --> 35:21.330
Do you remember

35:21.960 --> 35:23.560
what Elder Yue said

35:23.870 --> 35:25.930
were the three most important herbs?

35:26.520 --> 35:27.130
Wujiang,

35:28.070 --> 35:29.040
Xuyu grass,

35:30.110 --> 35:30.830
and Jiemao.

35:33.540 --> 35:34.550
It was

35:35.260 --> 35:36.920
an acrostic poem by Elder Yue.

35:37.110 --> 35:38.140
An acrostic poem?

35:39.330 --> 35:39.820
"Wu"...

35:40.660 --> 35:41.460
"xu"...

35:42.260 --> 35:42.790
"jie"...

35:43.300 --> 35:45.760
"Wu xu jie", that it doesn't need to be cured?

35:46.140 --> 35:46.940
That's right.

35:48.580 --> 35:50.380
The Heart Devouring Moon poison

35:50.620 --> 35:52.020
doesn't need to be cured.

35:52.270 --> 35:54.920
On the first day, you blurted out

35:55.820 --> 35:57.080
that the Heart Devouring Moon

35:57.080 --> 35:58.350
is an incurable poison.

35:58.350 --> 35:59.950
I was really surprised then.

36:00.320 --> 36:00.950
I thought

36:01.470 --> 36:02.250
you

36:02.460 --> 36:04.100
were too talented.

36:04.290 --> 36:06.750
Finding a solution for the incurable poison

36:06.870 --> 36:07.870
is the challenge.

36:08.620 --> 36:10.020
Now I finally understand

36:10.890 --> 36:12.380
what you meant back then.

36:12.970 --> 36:14.630
It's not that it's incurable,

36:14.980 --> 36:16.980
but that it doesn't need to be cured.

36:21.660 --> 36:22.790
The Fortnight Flies

36:23.620 --> 36:27.500
would make your whole body feel like it's being burned in a raging fire.

36:27.500 --> 36:29.160
If you don't get rid of it soon,

36:29.980 --> 36:31.840
the poison will attack the heart.

36:32.400 --> 36:33.780
Then, there'll be no cure for it.

36:33.780 --> 36:35.060
So what I took

36:37.310 --> 36:38.640
was not even poison.

36:41.410 --> 36:42.870
Not only was it not poison,

36:43.820 --> 36:45.820
but it's also a very precious tonic.

36:48.510 --> 36:50.240
This is also why the Herb Elixir

36:50.760 --> 36:53.090
doesn't work on the Heart Devouring Moon.

36:54.500 --> 36:55.300
That's right.

36:55.860 --> 36:57.520
After taking the Heart Devouring Moon,

36:57.520 --> 36:59.120
your body will be in pain.

37:00.860 --> 37:02.810
But as long as you can get through it,

37:02.810 --> 37:04.140
all poisoning symptoms

37:04.330 --> 37:05.730
will go away on their own.

37:11.470 --> 37:13.200
This is the page that I tore out.

37:13.950 --> 37:16.550
Actually, Lord Sword Wielder, you were right.

37:16.590 --> 37:18.190
It does include Kuxin grass.

37:20.500 --> 37:21.660
The Heart Devouring Moon

37:21.660 --> 37:22.940
is a strong tonic.

37:23.950 --> 37:26.340
It can greatly enhance your internal skill,

37:26.340 --> 37:27.600
strengthen your body,

37:27.710 --> 37:28.950
and prolong your life.

37:28.950 --> 37:31.720
There'll be gains and losses during the first consumption.

37:31.720 --> 37:34.700
According to the different internal skills of the consumers,

37:34.700 --> 37:37.030
it causes body heat or body chills

37:38.080 --> 37:40.040
along with the weakening of the internal skill.

37:40.040 --> 37:42.730
The blood vessels in the wrists become congested,

37:42.730 --> 37:44.130
the heart and lungs burn,

37:44.340 --> 37:46.400
and bodily pain is felt immediately.

37:46.660 --> 37:48.170
Then, you cough up blood.

37:53.400 --> 37:55.420
Later, your hands and feet become stiff.

37:55.420 --> 37:56.570
The blood congestion spreads along the arms

37:56.570 --> 37:57.830
and forms a black line.

37:58.460 --> 38:02.030
This is accompanied by spasms and severe pain in all your internal organs.

38:02.030 --> 38:02.660
And then

38:03.100 --> 38:04.960
all four limbs become paralyzed.

38:08.980 --> 38:10.510
It's really a good medicine

38:11.000 --> 38:13.270
where both parties suffer tremendous losses.

38:13.270 --> 38:14.700
Although it's considered

38:14.700 --> 38:16.360
that you've passed the trial,

38:16.950 --> 38:18.280
I still want to test you.

38:19.380 --> 38:20.380
The Qishe flower,

38:20.460 --> 38:24.260
the carrion beetle brain and the Bombyx silkworm are all poisonous.

38:24.300 --> 38:26.030
Why is it a tonic when combined?

38:26.420 --> 38:28.400
There are so many books in the library.

38:28.400 --> 38:31.200
Can someone like you who has a photographic memory

38:31.310 --> 38:32.570
answer this question?

38:33.140 --> 38:34.150
The Qishe flower

38:34.260 --> 38:35.980
causes severe heart and abdominal pains

38:35.980 --> 38:38.020
and reverses the flow of the meridians.

38:38.020 --> 38:39.150
The Bombyx silkworm

38:39.240 --> 38:40.640
is also highly poisonous

38:40.910 --> 38:44.340
and results in stagnation of your internal energy and stiffening of your movements.

38:44.340 --> 38:45.960
If the Qishe flower and Bombyx silkworm

38:45.960 --> 38:47.150
are taken together,

38:47.780 --> 38:49.840
your arms and legs become paralyzed.

38:52.340 --> 38:53.370
By using one poison to counteract the other poison,

38:53.370 --> 38:55.470
it's instead turned into a medicine with high efficacy.

38:55.470 --> 38:57.740
It's exactly because the meridians in the arms and legs are sealed

38:57.740 --> 38:59.000
that the concentrated energy of the internal skill

38:59.000 --> 39:01.330
can only exist between the heart and lungs.

39:01.330 --> 39:02.740
This accelerates the circulation

39:02.740 --> 39:03.540
which leads to

39:03.710 --> 39:06.670
the concentrated energy of the internal skill
switching from circulating along all meridians to just the Ren and Du meridians,

39:06.670 --> 39:08.810
such that it's even easier to open up the eight extraordinary meridians

39:08.810 --> 39:10.830
and your internal skill is strengthened quickly.

39:10.830 --> 39:12.700
But the carrion beetle brain dominates the meridians

39:12.700 --> 39:14.100
and is highly poisonous.

39:14.530 --> 39:16.040
A black line on the wrist

39:16.460 --> 39:19.270
indicates that the poison has begun to circulate all over the body.

39:19.270 --> 39:20.070
Lord Sword Wielder,

39:20.070 --> 39:21.730
have you figured this out too?

39:23.750 --> 39:26.350
The carrion beetle brain is usually consumed raw

39:26.350 --> 39:27.610
or crushed up directly

39:27.700 --> 39:29.360
and made into a potent poison.

39:30.030 --> 39:30.910
Could it be...

39:31.790 --> 39:33.520
the water-boiling technique?

39:34.540 --> 39:35.130
Yes.

39:36.270 --> 39:38.180
The carrion beetle brain is affected by temperature.

39:38.180 --> 39:41.240
After boiling it, its potency will be greatly reduced.

39:41.670 --> 39:43.300
Instead, it will increase your powers

39:43.300 --> 39:45.130
and have a miraculous effect that allows you to go beyond your limits.

39:45.130 --> 39:45.950
But

39:46.140 --> 39:47.570
in people's impressions,

39:47.570 --> 39:48.910
the carrion beetle brain has always been

39:48.910 --> 39:51.310
a potent poison that causes instant death,

39:51.390 --> 39:53.590
so its medicinal benefits are ignored.

39:54.160 --> 39:54.770
However,

39:55.740 --> 39:57.740
even though its potency is reduced,

39:57.950 --> 40:00.070
you'll still lose some of your internal skill

40:00.070 --> 40:01.600
in the process of taking it.

40:02.900 --> 40:04.080
As for the last herb,

40:04.310 --> 40:05.370
the Kuxin grass...

40:07.100 --> 40:10.000
Actually, I already detected the Kuxin grass's smell.

40:10.000 --> 40:10.950
But at that time,

40:10.950 --> 40:12.110
I doubted myself.

40:13.830 --> 40:14.750
This smells

40:15.340 --> 40:17.000
a little like the Kuxin grass.

40:18.780 --> 40:20.310
Could it be the Kuxin grass?

40:20.380 --> 40:21.710
Because the Kuxin grass

40:21.790 --> 40:23.600
is originally a good herb for antidotes,

40:23.600 --> 40:24.830
I never thought

40:25.040 --> 40:26.970
that it'd be added to make a poison.

40:27.400 --> 40:28.800
Now that I think about it,

40:28.870 --> 40:31.350
the reason the Kuxin grass was added from the start

40:31.350 --> 40:32.610
is to let the consumers

40:32.900 --> 40:33.900
detoxify slowly.

40:35.380 --> 40:36.010
But

40:37.310 --> 40:39.500
when mixed with more than three herbs,

40:40.020 --> 40:41.280
it will take some time,

40:41.580 --> 40:42.710
around half a month,

40:43.150 --> 40:44.210
for the Kuxin grass

40:44.450 --> 40:45.530
to take effect

40:45.920 --> 40:48.320
and initiate the detoxification process.

40:49.580 --> 40:50.210
So,

40:50.930 --> 40:52.990
the cycle of the Heart Devouring Moon

40:53.300 --> 40:54.180
is half a month.

40:56.620 --> 40:57.190
Yes.

40:58.130 --> 41:00.190
When the poison is completely cleared,

41:00.190 --> 41:01.050
your powers

41:01.680 --> 41:03.280
will naturally be restored.

41:03.420 --> 41:04.370
So, previously,

41:05.100 --> 41:06.910
when you saw me making all kinds of concoctions

41:06.910 --> 41:08.570
with different ingredients,

41:08.650 --> 41:10.510
you must have thought I was a fool.

41:10.880 --> 41:11.480
I dare not.

41:12.900 --> 41:15.030
It's just a test for the Sword Wielder.

41:15.380 --> 41:15.960
Besides,

41:16.380 --> 41:17.580
during this process,

41:18.060 --> 41:20.310
you read a lot of medical books, Sword Wielder.

41:20.310 --> 41:21.510
You've improved a lot

41:21.660 --> 41:23.590
in the knowledge of pharmacology.

41:24.350 --> 41:24.870
Besides

41:24.890 --> 41:27.080
the ability to learn pharmacology,

41:27.690 --> 41:32.920
trial takers also must have the determination and perseverance to risk their lives for medicine testing.

41:32.920 --> 41:34.790
The moment you were willing

41:34.790 --> 41:36.950
to take the Heart Devouring Moon and risk your life testing it,

41:36.950 --> 41:39.410
you already passed the test, Sword Wielder.

41:41.610 --> 41:42.390
I know.

41:42.850 --> 41:43.800
In that case,

41:44.430 --> 41:46.110
I want to tell you, Sword Wielder,

41:46.110 --> 41:46.910
this realm...

41:47.620 --> 41:48.220
Elder Yue.

41:50.900 --> 41:51.700
It's just that

41:52.220 --> 41:53.920
something unexpected happened.

41:53.920 --> 41:54.410
Yes.

41:55.480 --> 41:57.700
Young Master Shangjue happened to come visit me,

41:57.700 --> 41:58.630
so I was delayed.

42:00.270 --> 42:01.130
But, Elder Yue,

42:01.780 --> 42:03.540
what is it with

42:04.050 --> 42:05.850
the Eggs of Bone-Gnawing Flies?

42:05.980 --> 42:08.230
It's not some medicine that's beneficial.

42:08.230 --> 42:10.290
Sword Wielder, you are really sharp.

42:10.940 --> 42:12.270
The Bone-Gnawing Flies

42:12.350 --> 42:14.210
are the essence of this medicine.

42:15.140 --> 42:16.650
When the Bone-Gnawing Flies get inside the body,

42:16.650 --> 42:18.920
they will be attached to the eight extraordinary meridians

42:18.920 --> 42:20.520
and keep generating stimulation.

42:20.520 --> 42:21.670
It will make people

42:21.690 --> 42:23.690
use their internal skills to resist it unconsciously.

42:23.690 --> 42:25.310
Therefore, the host

42:25.730 --> 42:27.770
has to use their martial skills

42:28.390 --> 42:29.470
and aura 24 hours non-stop.

42:29.470 --> 42:31.400
No matter how diligent a person is,

42:31.610 --> 42:33.270
he wouldn't be able to do this.

42:33.920 --> 42:34.440
So,

42:35.890 --> 42:36.990
you mean

42:36.990 --> 42:39.800
even when that person's eating or sleeping, he's still practicing his martial skills?

42:39.800 --> 42:41.080
If you insist

42:42.510 --> 42:43.500
on putting it that way.

42:43.500 --> 42:45.010
That's too much.

42:47.740 --> 42:49.140
But Heart Devouring Moon

42:50.180 --> 42:51.780
also has a serious drawback.

42:53.180 --> 42:53.780
What is it?

42:55.470 --> 42:56.480
Other symptoms

42:56.610 --> 42:58.210
can be relieved by taking it,

43:00.050 --> 43:01.780
but the loss of internal skills

43:01.980 --> 43:02.910
is irreparable.

43:03.920 --> 43:04.780
In other words,

43:05.490 --> 43:06.550
every half a month,

43:08.030 --> 43:09.570
there'll be 4 hours when

43:10.260 --> 43:13.600
you're in a state of having no internal skills at all, Sword Wielder.

43:13.600 --> 43:15.530
That'll also be your Darkest Hour,

43:16.460 --> 43:17.920
the Hour of Lunar Eclipse.

43:21.180 --> 43:22.070
What if

43:22.470 --> 43:25.260
someone wants to assassinate me during that time?

43:25.260 --> 43:26.990
It'll be a piece of cake, right?

43:28.560 --> 43:29.890
So you have two options.

43:30.700 --> 43:31.200
One,

43:32.000 --> 43:33.390
during the Hour of Lunar Eclipse,

43:33.390 --> 43:36.390
find somewhere absolutely safe and stay there alone.

43:37.270 --> 43:40.410
Or, have someone skillful that you absolutely trust by your side.

43:40.410 --> 43:41.410
But this solution

43:41.940 --> 43:43.270
is not completely safe.

43:43.750 --> 43:45.080
So there's a second one.

43:50.700 --> 43:53.360
This is the formula of the Heart Devouring Moon.

43:54.500 --> 43:56.390
After you return to the front hill of the Gong Residence,

43:56.390 --> 43:57.460
make it yourself

43:58.140 --> 44:00.070
and choose a date to take it.

44:00.660 --> 44:02.290
Don't tell anyone about it.

44:02.900 --> 44:03.560
In this way,

44:04.160 --> 44:06.960
no one will know when your Hour of Lunar Eclipse is.

44:17.130 --> 44:18.200
So, Elder Yue,

44:19.310 --> 44:20.640
the Fortnight Flies...

44:20.780 --> 44:22.440
No, the Heart Devouring Moon.

44:23.530 --> 44:25.020
Are you sure there's no need to detoxicate it?

44:25.020 --> 44:27.550
Is it enough to endure the most painful hours?

44:29.650 --> 44:30.190
Yes.

44:34.220 --> 44:35.350
I have one more thing

44:35.950 --> 44:37.150
to ask you, Elder Yue.

44:39.310 --> 44:39.840
Go ahead.

44:42.040 --> 44:43.170
Is it true

44:44.520 --> 44:45.780
about the truth grass?

44:46.300 --> 44:46.760
Right.

44:47.230 --> 44:49.290
What's the deal with the truth grass?

44:50.110 --> 44:51.580
You took it,

44:51.660 --> 44:53.060
yet you still tricked me.

44:53.070 --> 44:55.070
Why did you tell me about Xuyu grass?

44:55.190 --> 44:57.190
Xuyu grass wasn't necessary at all.

44:59.370 --> 45:01.700
Since the truth grass was developed by me,

45:02.980 --> 45:05.040
of course I know how to detoxicate it.

45:05.270 --> 45:07.220
Then why did you hide the Xuyu grass?

45:07.220 --> 45:08.750
I put so much effort into it,

45:09.090 --> 45:10.820
yet you still want to complain?

45:12.710 --> 45:15.040
You only got to know Miss Yun's love is real

45:15.100 --> 45:17.030
since there was only one antidote,

45:17.370 --> 45:18.030
didn't you?

45:21.360 --> 45:22.450
People can lie,

45:23.300 --> 45:25.900
but the decisions they make wouldn't.

45:26.870 --> 45:28.480
You did so much for Miss Yun.

45:29.640 --> 45:32.500
You were even willing to give her the only antidote.

45:32.870 --> 45:35.200
Even if Miss Yun's heart was made of stone,

45:35.880 --> 45:37.210
it should have bloomed.

45:38.570 --> 45:40.940
Just like how Xuyu grass grows

45:41.780 --> 45:43.340
on the steep iceberg cliff.

45:44.110 --> 45:45.840
When faced with life and death,

45:46.860 --> 45:49.060
she was willing to give you the antidote

45:49.720 --> 45:51.650
and leave the chance to live to you.

45:52.310 --> 45:54.110
That's the most precious thing.

45:54.300 --> 45:54.830
Isn't it?

45:58.100 --> 45:58.690
So,

45:59.740 --> 46:01.400
why did you help us, Elder Yue?

46:07.770 --> 46:08.900
I just hope

46:09.550 --> 46:10.370
lovers

46:10.920 --> 46:12.250
can have a happy ending.

46:15.290 --> 46:16.020
It seems

46:16.550 --> 46:18.280
I shouldn't call you Elder Yue.

46:18.440 --> 46:20.500
You're more like God of Matchmaking.

46:21.900 --> 46:23.900
Truly, I'm like God of Matchmaking.

46:24.090 --> 46:26.890
I've facilitated countless couples in the world.

46:27.450 --> 46:28.290
Only I

46:29.720 --> 46:31.000
am always alone.

46:33.500 --> 46:35.830
I've been an excellent doctor all my life,

46:36.130 --> 46:37.930
but I can't cure the pain of love.

46:40.220 --> 46:42.080
Doctors can't treat themselves.

46:42.380 --> 46:44.780
You can only help others, but not yourself.

46:45.300 --> 46:46.500
The pain of love...

46:47.380 --> 46:48.380
How is it painful?

46:51.230 --> 46:52.630
I think it's quite sweet.

47:41.620 --> 47:42.780
Your moving techniques

47:42.780 --> 47:43.510
and internal skills

47:43.510 --> 47:44.610
have both improved, Sword Wielder.

47:44.610 --> 47:45.210
Thank you.

47:58.430 --> 47:59.560
Thank you, Miss Yun.

48:04.310 --> 48:06.660
The Heart Devouring Moon has been detoxicated.

48:06.660 --> 48:07.610
And we have both

48:07.820 --> 48:09.080
almost recovered.

48:10.130 --> 48:12.460
It's time for us to return to the front hill.

48:12.460 --> 48:14.460
You can't leave yet, Sword Wielder.

48:14.620 --> 48:15.170
Why?

48:15.820 --> 48:17.670
You learned

48:18.220 --> 48:21.470
the Three Forms of Snow Saber when you passed the first test, right?

48:21.470 --> 48:21.910
Yes.

48:23.430 --> 48:24.670
You lied to me,

48:25.070 --> 48:27.060
saying that the Snow Saber Scripture is under the Ice Pool,

48:27.060 --> 48:28.260
and asked me to get it.

48:28.300 --> 48:30.570
Although the first test is a test of internal skills,

48:30.570 --> 48:33.570
the purpose was to teach you the Three Forms of Snow Saber.

48:33.570 --> 48:34.120
However,

48:34.430 --> 48:36.600
without enough internal skills,

48:37.190 --> 48:39.580
one wouldn't be able to learn the Three Forms of Snow Saber.

48:39.580 --> 48:40.240
Similarly,

48:40.710 --> 48:41.430
although the Heart Devouring Moon

48:41.430 --> 48:44.310
seems to be the test of poison making and detoxicating skills,

48:44.310 --> 48:45.270
the key purpose

48:45.860 --> 48:47.650
is to improve

48:47.790 --> 48:49.100
the trial taker's internal skills

48:49.100 --> 48:51.680
so that he can master more sophisticated saber techniques of the Gong family.

48:51.680 --> 48:54.070
You also have saber techniques to teach me?

48:54.070 --> 48:55.600
Starting with the New Moon.

48:55.630 --> 48:57.270
Wrangling during the Full Moon.

48:57.270 --> 48:59.030
Killing during the Crescent Moon.

48:59.030 --> 49:00.430
Sounds pretty powerful.

49:03.340 --> 49:04.070
So, Miss Yun,

49:05.340 --> 49:07.540
you should return to the front hill first

49:07.540 --> 49:11.540
and bring back the good news that the Sword Wielder has passed the trial.

49:17.390 --> 49:17.900
Yun.

49:18.650 --> 49:19.710
Why are you crying?

49:22.480 --> 49:24.880
Miss Yun must be reluctant to part with you.

49:31.910 --> 49:32.750
Go back first.

49:33.270 --> 49:34.270
I'll be back soon.

49:37.220 --> 49:39.680
My lovesickness and melancholy is endless.

49:41.470 --> 49:43.930
I'll tell you all about it when you come back.

49:45.200 --> 49:47.130
I'll wait for you at the Yu Lineage.

49:48.230 --> 49:48.990
Wait for me.

50:00.690 --> 50:01.490
Young Master.

50:03.230 --> 50:04.930
Yun Weishan has returned to the Yu Lineage.

50:04.930 --> 50:08.260
It seems that Gong Ziyu has made it through the second realm.

50:09.570 --> 50:10.980
He really

50:11.950 --> 50:12.930
impressed me.

50:14.070 --> 50:15.240
Is there any news

50:15.470 --> 50:16.200
of Lady Wuji?

50:16.670 --> 50:18.080
She stays at the Yu Lineage every day.

50:18.080 --> 50:19.220
On the first and fifteenth day of every lunar month,

50:19.220 --> 50:20.620
she goes to the ancestral hall in the back hill

50:20.620 --> 50:21.990
to recite sutras for the former Sword Wielder.

50:21.990 --> 50:22.950
Nothing else

50:23.730 --> 50:24.340
for now.

50:25.660 --> 50:26.190
Brother.

50:26.940 --> 50:28.400
Do you still suspect Wuji?

50:30.830 --> 50:32.160
I still can't trust her.

50:39.360 --> 50:40.470
You just came back to the Yu Lineage.

50:40.470 --> 50:41.840
I'm sorry

50:42.320 --> 50:44.520
that I summoned you here in such a hurry.

50:44.970 --> 50:45.830
Don't say that.

50:46.270 --> 50:49.870
I know you're concerned about the Sword Wielder, Your Ladyship.

50:49.900 --> 50:50.260
So Ziyu...

50:50.260 --> 50:51.590
I've also been worried.

50:52.170 --> 50:53.900
While Gong Ziyu was away,

50:54.420 --> 50:56.580
Jin Fan had a long face every day.

50:57.300 --> 50:58.030
I've also...

50:59.340 --> 51:01.070
I've also been very depressed.

51:03.500 --> 51:04.510
Don't worry.

51:05.010 --> 51:06.210
Young Master is fine.

51:06.630 --> 51:08.630
And he has made it through the trial.

51:08.980 --> 51:10.180
He's not back yet

51:10.260 --> 51:13.720
because he still has to learn saber techniques from Elder Yue.

51:15.030 --> 51:15.760
That's good.

51:16.060 --> 51:16.840
It seems

51:17.150 --> 51:18.620
my left eyelid

51:18.640 --> 51:20.150
defeated my right eyelid.

51:20.830 --> 51:22.440
The twitch of the left eyelid portends wealth.

51:22.440 --> 51:23.700
So that was a good omen.

51:23.920 --> 51:25.340
Next time it twitches,

51:25.990 --> 51:27.650
it will double the merriness.

51:27.740 --> 51:29.900
And happiness... Happiness comes in pairs.

51:29.900 --> 51:30.890
Your Ladyship.

51:30.970 --> 51:33.390
Look, Jin Fan is blushing.

51:34.330 --> 51:36.730
You said your right eyelid twitched badly.

51:40.820 --> 51:41.710
What else?

51:41.710 --> 51:42.640
Tell us about it.

51:45.300 --> 51:46.360
Midway through it,

51:47.630 --> 51:49.030
Gong Shangjue came once.

51:58.110 --> 51:58.760
It's okay.

52:12.970 --> 52:13.620
Elder Yue.

52:14.770 --> 52:15.830
There's something

52:15.860 --> 52:16.920
I'm curious about.

52:18.220 --> 52:18.890
What is it?

52:19.730 --> 52:21.590
Who took the Heart Devouring Moon

52:22.140 --> 52:24.340
during Young Master Shangjue's trial?

52:24.980 --> 52:26.310
It was his subordinate.

52:27.630 --> 52:28.320
Jin Fu?

52:31.450 --> 52:32.250
It wasn't him.

52:35.500 --> 52:36.630
It was someone else.

52:37.420 --> 52:37.900
Oh.

52:39.620 --> 52:42.390
It didn't take Young Master Shangjue very long to think.

52:42.390 --> 52:44.250
He also ate Heart Devouring Moon.

52:44.770 --> 52:46.370
He tested medicine in person

52:46.430 --> 52:47.770
for a guardian.

52:48.570 --> 52:49.450
It shows

52:49.750 --> 52:51.870
that although Young Master Shangjue

52:51.970 --> 52:53.430
is stubborn and ruthless,

52:53.860 --> 52:54.790
he's actually

52:54.790 --> 52:56.260
a loyal and gentle person.

53:00.630 --> 53:01.950
He's not gentle

53:02.390 --> 53:03.400
with me.

53:04.580 --> 53:06.380
He made things difficult for me again and again.

53:06.380 --> 53:07.980
Even Miss Yun was not spared.

53:11.050 --> 53:13.710
Although I don't agree with some of his actions,

53:15.230 --> 53:16.430
I can understand him.

53:16.470 --> 53:18.000
You can empathize with him?

53:21.000 --> 53:22.750
In fact, from his point of view,

53:23.130 --> 53:24.740
he just hopes people in the position of the Sword Wielder

53:24.740 --> 53:25.790
can be capable.

53:26.550 --> 53:27.680
And because of this,

53:28.920 --> 53:29.530
you

53:29.550 --> 53:31.810
should pass the Trial of the Three Realms

53:32.050 --> 53:33.980
and be a convincing Sword Wielder.

53:38.610 --> 53:40.620
What kind of person is he?

53:50.810 --> 53:51.460
How about

53:51.990 --> 53:53.690
you give me your truth grass

53:55.180 --> 53:56.150
so that I can know

53:56.360 --> 53:58.590
whether he is a good person or a bad person?

53:58.590 --> 54:01.460
Sword Wielder is the center of the power of the Gong family.

54:01.460 --> 54:03.500
In the future, you have to face countless people.

54:03.500 --> 54:06.460
It'll be hard for you to tell whether they're loyal or treacherous.

54:06.460 --> 54:07.620
Discerning people's thoughts

54:07.620 --> 54:09.210
relies on keen insight.

54:09.510 --> 54:11.310
How can you rely on other things?

54:13.140 --> 54:13.710
Besides,

54:14.380 --> 54:16.440
even if you have truth grass, so what?

54:16.920 --> 54:18.520
Didn't you refuse to believe

54:20.470 --> 54:22.070
what Miss Yun said?

54:26.610 --> 54:28.120
You're right.

54:29.380 --> 54:31.100
Nothing can escape your...

54:34.230 --> 54:36.890
I know you want to describe my eyes as dogs' eyes.

54:42.110 --> 54:43.040
Anyway,

54:43.900 --> 54:45.630
even if there is no truth grass,

54:46.380 --> 54:48.440
I'm willing to believe what she says.

54:52.870 --> 54:54.470
Being willing to believe her

54:54.480 --> 54:55.480
and believing her

54:57.210 --> 54:58.670
are two different things.

55:10.930 --> 55:13.260
Gong Shangjue is really something.

55:13.660 --> 55:15.700
He even gave trouble in the back hill.

55:15.700 --> 55:16.580
I told you.

55:16.580 --> 55:18.010
I had a premonition.

55:19.840 --> 55:22.300
Fortunately, Ziyu and Elder Yue were there.

55:22.510 --> 55:23.390
Otherwise,

55:25.470 --> 55:26.470
you would have...

55:27.320 --> 55:29.320
I've dispelled his suspicion on me.

55:30.070 --> 55:31.620
I think he won't make things difficult for me again

55:31.620 --> 55:32.800
in the future.

55:34.900 --> 55:37.530
He's been coveting the position of the Sword Wielder for a long time.

55:37.530 --> 55:38.980
He makes things difficult for you

55:38.980 --> 55:40.970
because he wants to find dirt on Ziyu

55:40.970 --> 55:41.900
and replace him.

55:42.990 --> 55:44.390
This person is very deep.

55:45.850 --> 55:46.770
You and Ziyu

55:46.870 --> 55:48.600
should be careful at all times.

55:52.340 --> 55:53.070
Understood.

55:54.100 --> 55:56.370
Send someone to continue to keep an eye on Lady Wuji.

55:56.370 --> 55:58.090
If there really is something wrong,

55:58.090 --> 56:00.150
she'll give her away sooner or later.

56:00.650 --> 56:01.010
Yes.

56:06.660 --> 56:07.990
Young Master Shangjue.

56:08.870 --> 56:09.330
Come in.

56:16.790 --> 56:17.310
Young Master.

56:17.310 --> 56:18.260
These are the new clothes you ordered us

56:18.260 --> 56:19.810
to prepare for Miss Shangguan.

56:19.810 --> 56:20.870
Please have a look.

56:21.030 --> 56:21.700
No need.

56:22.150 --> 56:23.080
Deliver it over.

56:23.240 --> 56:23.680
Yes.

56:26.160 --> 56:27.490
Say what you want to say.

56:30.720 --> 56:31.490
No need.

56:32.060 --> 56:32.500
I...

56:33.430 --> 56:34.760
I can see it on your face.

56:36.340 --> 56:36.740
Humph.

56:44.620 --> 56:45.400
Lady Wuji.

56:45.860 --> 56:46.620
Put it here.

56:47.040 --> 56:47.460
Yes.

56:52.120 --> 56:53.020
Wow.

56:53.340 --> 56:54.280
Miss Yun.

56:54.700 --> 56:56.340
Sword Wielder is so nice to you.

56:56.340 --> 56:58.000
The clothes are so beautiful.

56:58.550 --> 57:00.170
I'm so jealous.

57:01.090 --> 57:02.550
You're Eldest Young Miss.

57:02.620 --> 57:04.280
What's there to be jealous of?

57:09.260 --> 57:11.190
Yours have already been delivered to the Shang residence.

57:11.190 --> 57:11.870
Really?

57:13.690 --> 57:14.220
Goodbye.

57:17.160 --> 57:17.710
Jin Fan.

57:19.110 --> 57:20.190
Wipe your saliva.

57:20.440 --> 57:22.500
Lady Wuji is still here. Hold it back.

57:23.340 --> 57:26.400
I'll come to you when I get changed. There's no hurry.

57:58.980 --> 58:01.530
Gong, Shang, Jue, Zhi, and Yu.

58:02.370 --> 58:03.350
Only I am

58:03.690 --> 58:05.120
a beauty.

58:05.870 --> 58:06.570
Ah.

58:21.250 --> 58:22.780
This knife is so beautiful.

58:23.560 --> 58:24.360
My knife

58:24.740 --> 58:25.940
is called Moonlight.

58:27.450 --> 58:28.160
Moonlight?

58:32.380 --> 58:32.910
How is it?

58:34.910 --> 58:35.540
I'm fine.

58:35.750 --> 58:36.610
I just got a cut.

58:37.380 --> 58:38.180
I'm asking you

58:38.460 --> 58:39.570
how my knife is.

58:44.950 --> 58:45.950
What do you think?

58:50.910 --> 58:52.400
Your knife

58:53.430 --> 58:54.630
has a smooth surface.

58:54.710 --> 58:55.790
Its edge

58:56.160 --> 58:57.380
is quite sharp.

58:58.330 --> 58:59.730
It's indeed a good knife.

59:01.670 --> 59:02.800
You have good taste.

59:04.380 --> 59:05.150
But

59:06.250 --> 59:08.250
it hurts people by accident easily.

59:09.060 --> 59:10.260
I need some ointment.

59:10.620 --> 59:11.920
Wait for me there.

59:12.300 --> 59:14.560
You want ointment for such a small wound?

59:15.510 --> 59:17.380
Your surname is Gong, and your first name is Ziyu.

59:17.380 --> 59:18.390
Is your nickname Delicate?

59:18.390 --> 59:19.650
I don't want to hear it.

59:23.700 --> 59:25.800
I'll wait for you in the bamboo forest outside the Yue residence.

59:25.800 --> 59:26.370
Hurry up.

59:27.210 --> 59:28.430
Ointment.

59:29.060 --> 59:30.340
Ointment.

59:30.990 --> 59:31.580
Oint...

59:38.620 --> 59:39.350
Truth grass.

59:51.850 --> 59:52.780
Truth grass.

59:56.540 --> 59:57.630
Wubaizi.

59:58.300 --> 59:59.200
Xuanshen.

01:00:00.660 --> 01:00:01.410
Luokui.

01:00:02.820 --> 01:00:03.620
It's strange.

01:00:04.230 --> 01:00:07.030
Why do they smell like ordinary herbal medicines?

01:00:38.800 --> 01:00:39.620
A mirror.

01:00:40.500 --> 01:00:41.280
Hairpins.

01:00:41.970 --> 01:00:48.300
[Where to send my hair? I'm worrying about your lack of clothing. I'm not jealous of the world. Clouds weave rain.]

01:00:50.880 --> 01:00:52.210
A woman once lived here.

01:01:25.770 --> 01:01:26.900
Thank you, Miss Yun.

01:01:47.410 --> 01:01:49.240
[Shang]

01:01:54.220 --> 01:01:55.580
You scared me.

01:01:56.630 --> 01:01:58.330
I thought I ran into a thug

01:01:58.940 --> 01:02:00.270
who wanted to kidnap me,

01:02:00.580 --> 01:02:02.740
a poor, innocent, and beautiful girl.

01:02:04.470 --> 01:02:06.340
Poor, innocent, and beautiful.

01:02:07.220 --> 01:02:09.280
You have to remove at least two words.

01:02:10.410 --> 01:02:11.940
Then only "beautiful girl"

01:02:12.340 --> 01:02:13.350
is left.

01:02:13.790 --> 01:02:14.380
Beautiful girl.

01:02:14.380 --> 01:02:15.780
Hand me some lead powder.

01:02:20.910 --> 01:02:21.710
Hurry up.

01:02:24.680 --> 01:02:26.820
I'm wearing new clothes.

01:02:29.320 --> 01:02:30.090
Actually,

01:02:30.470 --> 01:02:33.100
you don't have to dress beautifully when you see me.

01:02:33.100 --> 01:02:34.210
I'm not ready yet.

01:02:36.350 --> 01:02:38.310
You're so thick-skinned.

01:02:38.750 --> 01:02:39.900
Who came to see you?

01:02:40.980 --> 01:02:42.660
I was going to see Jin Fan.

01:02:43.270 --> 01:02:44.110
But

01:02:44.550 --> 01:02:45.790
after I got changed,

01:02:46.190 --> 01:02:47.660
you took me here by tooth.

01:02:50.160 --> 01:02:51.090
It's "by force".

01:02:52.170 --> 01:02:52.660
What?

01:02:52.970 --> 01:02:53.640
Forget it.

01:02:54.020 --> 01:02:54.740
Hand me some lead powder.

01:02:54.740 --> 01:02:55.430
Thank you.

01:03:27.800 --> 01:03:30.380
[New Moon]

01:03:59.330 --> 01:04:01.580
[Little Wangyue]

01:04:16.430 --> 01:04:18.850
[Moonbreak]

01:04:43.590 --> 01:04:44.240
Elder Yue.

01:04:44.980 --> 01:04:46.260
The Three Forms of Moon Slash

01:04:46.260 --> 01:04:48.880
looks much more powerful than the Three Forms of Snow Saber.

01:04:48.880 --> 01:04:49.870
Look at you.

01:04:50.780 --> 01:04:52.840
If you see Young Master Xue next time,

01:04:53.040 --> 01:04:53.880
don't...

01:04:55.250 --> 01:04:56.950
Don't forget what you said.

01:04:57.670 --> 01:04:58.700
You have to say it loudly

01:04:58.700 --> 01:04:59.900
in front of him again.

01:05:01.260 --> 01:05:02.710
This is the saber scripture.

01:05:02.710 --> 01:05:04.830
You can't take it out of the Yue residence.

01:05:04.830 --> 01:05:05.440
So,

01:05:04.950 --> 01:05:08.570
[Three Forms of Moon Slash]

01:05:05.990 --> 01:05:07.270
once you memorize it,

01:05:07.500 --> 01:05:08.460
you can leave.

01:05:11.630 --> 01:05:12.330
I see.

01:05:12.790 --> 01:05:14.250
Go back and practice hard.

01:05:14.260 --> 01:05:15.270
With your wisdom,

01:05:15.460 --> 01:05:17.140
you'll definitely make rapid progress.

01:05:17.140 --> 01:05:18.510
I won't let you down.

01:05:32.430 --> 01:05:32.830
Hey.

01:05:32.870 --> 01:05:33.520
Jin Fan.

01:05:34.130 --> 01:05:34.890
You're back.

01:05:35.290 --> 01:05:36.110
Come here.

01:05:36.460 --> 01:05:37.620
Let's drink together.

01:05:37.620 --> 01:05:39.620
You're still drinking at this hour?

01:05:39.700 --> 01:05:40.310
We heard

01:05:40.600 --> 01:05:42.400
Sword Wielder passed the trial.

01:05:42.830 --> 01:05:44.280
We're celebrating.

01:05:44.490 --> 01:05:45.020
Come here.

01:05:45.020 --> 01:05:45.830
Come here.

01:05:46.800 --> 01:05:48.440
Come here.

01:05:52.810 --> 01:05:53.210
Hey.

01:05:53.860 --> 01:05:54.930
Don't drink too much.

01:05:54.930 --> 01:05:56.340
If you get drunk,

01:05:56.480 --> 01:05:58.750
you'll make mistakes during the day shift.

01:05:58.750 --> 01:06:00.540
I won't get drunk.

01:06:00.790 --> 01:06:01.710
Nonsense.

01:06:01.740 --> 01:06:03.160
When you were drunk last time,

01:06:03.160 --> 01:06:04.360
you talked nonsense.

01:06:05.290 --> 01:06:06.780
He said he saw a handsome young man

01:06:06.780 --> 01:06:08.350
in the prison.

01:06:09.130 --> 01:06:09.860
What prison?

01:06:10.140 --> 01:06:11.400
He was drunk last time.

01:06:11.670 --> 01:06:12.930
He was in a daze.

01:06:13.310 --> 01:06:14.110
He said

01:06:14.130 --> 01:06:17.110
on the night when the former Sword Wielder and the former Young Lord were killed,

01:06:17.110 --> 01:06:17.970
he saw

01:06:18.120 --> 01:06:19.000
a handsome man

01:06:19.050 --> 01:06:20.220
who looked like a god

01:06:20.540 --> 01:06:21.940
in the prison

01:06:22.130 --> 01:06:24.280
passing by the cell where the female assassin from the Wufeng

01:06:24.280 --> 01:06:25.210
was imprisoned.

01:06:25.940 --> 01:06:27.510
What are the characteristics

01:06:27.510 --> 01:06:28.620
of the young man you mentioned?

01:06:28.620 --> 01:06:29.000
Hey.

01:06:29.820 --> 01:06:30.300
Look.

01:06:30.580 --> 01:06:31.190
Jin Fan

01:06:31.310 --> 01:06:33.100
believes me.

01:06:34.460 --> 01:06:35.200
Jin Fan.

01:06:35.620 --> 01:06:38.120
He was wearing plain clothes.

01:06:38.560 --> 01:06:41.560
There seemed to be some cloud patterns on his clothes.

01:06:41.940 --> 01:06:42.540
By the way,

01:06:43.120 --> 01:06:45.030
I think the new Elder Yue

01:06:45.580 --> 01:06:46.690
and that young man

01:06:46.710 --> 01:06:47.970
have the same body shape.

01:06:47.970 --> 01:06:49.820
The more you say, the more outrageous it becomes.

01:06:49.820 --> 01:06:51.590
Don't let Elder Yue hear it.

01:06:52.780 --> 01:06:53.510
Let's drink.

01:06:53.900 --> 01:06:54.570
Here.
